# ─── API Origin ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave this UNSET in local development — requests are made to a relative
# path and Vite's dev server proxies "/api" to http://localhost:5000 for you
# (see vite.config.ts). Only set this for a production/staging build, where
# there is no dev proxy and the client needs the real API origin, e.g.:
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.renthub.app
VITE_API_URL=
